To prove Part (A), observe that condition~\eqref{(Q1Q2Ta)} holds automatically when $\widetilde f(X_2-X_1)=-\infty $ or $\widetilde g(X_1-X_2) =+\infty $, therefore, it suffices to require~\eqref{(Q1Q2Ta)} only when $X_1 \ominus X_2 \subseteq S_P$, which is just~\eqref{(Q1Qq-mF-1)}.
