Round 1        & Q2.1, Q3.1, Q4.1 & Types of explanation needs~\cite{droste2024explanations}                          & \textbf{0.68}  \\ \hline
Round 2        & Q2.2, Q3.2, Q4.2 & Behavior-based and event-based indicators           & \textbf{0.61}  \\ \hline
Round 3        & Q5               & Behavior-based and event-based indicators           & \textbf{0.59}  \\ \hline
