% Similarly, airflow visualization techniques like PIV and Schlieren imaging could provide insights into the dynamic behavior of molecular signals in turbulent environments, improving the accuracy of \ac{MC} channel models. 
% Conversely, the \ac{MC} community's expertise in signal modulation and interference management, as demonstrated in MIMO systems~\cite{koo2016molecular} and mobile \ac{MC} testbeds~\cite{qiu2016mobile}, could inspire new approaches for targeted drug delivery or swarm robotics, where precise control of molecular signals is critical. 
