$\Gamma = \{\Gamma_\mathcal{C}, \Gamma_{\mathcal{C}'}, \Gamma_{\mathcal{C}''}, ...\}$. We present our model for callbacks, chains, and executors as below. Without loss of generality, we assume the discrete-time model in our system, in which a time interval is a non-negative integer multiplier of the system time unit (e.g., clock cycle).

