%    If $i = a, P = P_j^\mathrm{left}$: Every point in $P$ and thus also the starting point of $\ell$ lies above the minimum height \todo{insert name of variable min height} and inside the cone $\Cone_{j,a}^\mathrm{left}$. This together with the fact that $\ell$ ends on the convex hull of $Q$ gives us that $\ell$ cuts the vertical line through the anchor point $a_a^j$ truly above $y=0.5$ and we find an outside point on $\ell$ directly to the left of this cutting point.

